    (target_deck_id, 'play a trick on', 'play a trick on', NULL, '搞恶作剧; 开玩笑；诈骗', 'I guess they play a trick on the new employee every April first.', '我想每年的愚人节，同事都会戏弄一下新进员工吧。', NULL, ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3023, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_23"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'poet', 'poet', '''poət', 'n. 诗人', 'He was a painter and poet.', '他是一位画家兼诗人。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3024, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_24"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'Columbus Day', 'columbus day', NULL, '哥伦布日', 'In 1968, Congress passed the Monday Holiday law, which moved Memorial Day, Columbus Day, Veterans Day and Washington’s Birthday from their original dates to Mondays.', '1968年，国会通过了星期一假期日法，这一法案将阵亡战士纪念日，哥伦布发现美洲纪念日，退伍军人节和华盛顿诞辰纪念日这些节日从原定日期都移到了周一。', NULL, ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3025, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_25"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'arrival', 'arrival', 'ə''raɪvəl', 'n. 到来；到达', 'Only the timely arrival of the police prevented the situation from becoming worse.', '警方及时赶到才阻止了事态恶化。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3026, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_26"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'Christopher Columbus', 'christopher columbus', NULL, '克利斯朵夫•哥伦布（意大利航海家）', 'But the real question for Christopher Columbus was: How do I best get to the West Indies?', '但对克里斯多夫·哥伦布而言，真正的问题是，我怎样才能最快到达西印度？', NULL, ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3027, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_27"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'gain', 'gain', 'ɡen', 'v. 获得；得到', 'After gaining independence in 1957, it was renamed ‘Ghana’.', '1957年获得独立后，该国改名为“加纳”。', 'v', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3028, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_28"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'independence', 'independence', ',ɪndɪ''pɛndəns', 'n. 独立；自主', 'The country has made great advances since independence.', '该国自独立以来发展迅速。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3029, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_29"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'independent', 'independent', '''ɪndɪ''pɛndənt', 'adj. 独立的；自主的', 'There are plans to split the corporation into a number of smaller independent companies.', '有计划要把这家大企业分割成一些独立的小公司。', 'adj', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3030, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_30"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'gather', 'gather', '''ɡæðɚ', 'v. 集合；聚集；搜集', 'A crowd gathered to watch the fight.', '一群人聚拢来围观打架。', 'v', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3031, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_31"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'agriculture', 'agriculture', '''æɡrɪkʌltʃɚ', 'n. 农业；农艺；农学', 'More than 75% of the land is used for agriculture.', '75%以上的土地用于农耕。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3', 'PEPGaoZhong_9']::text[], 3032, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_32"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'agricultural', 'agricultural', ',ægrɪ''kʌltʃərəl', 'adj. 农业的；农艺的', 'Farmers struggling for survival strip the forests for agricultural land.', '为生存而挣扎的农民们把森林伐光来作农业用地。', 'adj', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_3']::text[], 3033, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_3_33"}'::jsonb),
