    (target_deck_id, 'abolition', 'abolition', ',æbə''lɪʃən', 'n. 废除；废止', 'The abolition of slavery in Brazil and the Caribbean closely followed the pattern of the United States.', '巴西和加勒比海地区对奴隶制的废除很大程度上遵循了美国的模式。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_7']::text[], 7052, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_7_52"}'::jsonb),
