    (target_deck_id, 'earphone', 'earphone', '''ɪr,fon', 'n. 耳机', 'The reason for this is that the useful earphone control button / mic requires special jack.', '这么设计的原因是耳机的控制按钮（同时也是麦克风）需要特殊插孔。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_7']::text[], 7073, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_7_73"}'::jsonb),
