    (target_deck_id, 'garment', 'garment', '''gɑrmənt', 'n. （一件）衣服（外套、裙、袍等）；服装', 'She pulled the garment on and zipped it up.', '她穿上衣服并拉好拉链。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8', 'PEPGaoZhong_9']::text[], 8270, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_270"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'woollen', 'woollen', '''wʊlən', 'adj. 毛纺的；纯毛的（<美>woolen）', 'a woollen scarf', '羊毛围巾', 'adj', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8271, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_271"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'hesitate', 'hesitate', 'ˈhɛzətet', 'v. 犹豫；踌躇', 'I hesitate in this work.', '我在这个作品中有所犹豫。', 'v', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8272, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_272"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'uncomfortably', 'uncomfortably', 'ʌn''kʌmftəbli', 'adv. 不舒服的；不自在地', 'I sat uncomfortably in my superseat for the rest of the journey feeling like a rotten heel.', '在余下的旅程中，我浑身不自在地坐在我的“特等座”上，觉得自己差劲透了。', 'adv', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8274, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_274"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'troublesome', 'troublesome', '''trʌblsəm', 'adj. 带来麻烦的；使人心烦的', 'a troublesome child', '烦人的孩子', 'adj', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8275, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_275"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'wallet', 'wallet', '''wɑlɪt', 'n. 皮夹；钱包', 'He took a credit card out of his wallet.', '他从钱包里拿出一张信用卡。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8276, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_276"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'outcome', 'outcome', NULL, 'n. 结果；效果', 'People who had heard the evidence at the trial were surprised at the outcome.', '在审判过程中听过证词的人都对此结果感到吃惊。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8277, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_277"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'thief', 'thief', 'θif', 'n. 小偷；贼', 'Thieves broke into the offices and stole $150,000’s worth of computer equipment.', '小偷破门进入办公室，偷走了价值15万美元的电脑设备。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8278, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_278"}'::jsonb),
    (target_deck_id, 'handkerchief', 'handkerchief', '''hæŋkɚtʃɪf', 'n. 手帕；手绢；纸巾', 'She waved away his offer of the handkerchief.', '她挥手拒绝了他递过来的手帕。', 'n', ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_8']::text[], 8279, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_8_279"}'::jsonb),
