    (target_deck_id, 'the Danube River', 'the danube river', NULL, '多瑙河（位于欧洲）', 'Romania is situated in southeastern Europe, bordered by Ukraine and Moldova in the northeast; Hungary in the west; Serbia and Bulgaria to the south along the Danube River.', '罗马尼亚位于欧洲东南部，东北面和乌克兰及摩尔多瓦接壤，西面和匈牙利接壤，南面隔着多瑙河的是塞尔维亚和保加利亚。', NULL, ARRAY['PEP', 'GaoZhong', 'PEPGaoZhong_9']::text[], 9056, '{"originalId":"PEPGaoZhong_9_56"}'::jsonb),
